{"path":"identifier_with_special_meaning/override","title":"C++ identifier with special meaning: override (since C++11)","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">C++ identifier with special meaning:</span><code>override</code><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(since C++11)</span>","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/identifier_with_special_meaning/override","section":"identifier_with_special_meaning","kind":"page","summary":"","html":"<h3 id=\"Usage\">Usage</h3>\n<ul><li> <a href=\"/w/cpp/language/override\"><code>override</code></a> specifier\n</li></ul>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"kw1\">struct</span> b\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"kw4\">void</span> f0<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"kw4\">void</span> f1<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">virtual</span> <span class=\"kw4\">void</span> f2<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">virtual</span> <span class=\"kw4\">void</span> f3<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">virtual</span> <span class=\"kw4\">void</span> f4<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">virtual</span> <span class=\"kw4\">void</span> f5<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw1\">struct</span> d <span class=\"sy4\">:</span> b\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"kw4\">void</span> f0<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>                        <span class=\"co1\">// OK. Neither: b::f0 nor d::f0 are virtual.</span>\n    <span class=\"kw4\">void</span> f1<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> override <span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>               <span class=\"co1\">// Error: cannot override non-virtual b::f1.</span>\n    <span class=\"kw4\">void</span> f2<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> override <span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>               <span class=\"co1\">// OK. Member function d::f2 is virtual.</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">virtual</span> <span class=\"kw4\">void</span> f3<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>                <span class=\"co1\">// OK. Specifier 'override'  is optional.</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">virtual</span> <span class=\"kw4\">void</span> f4<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> override <span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>       <span class=\"co1\">// OK. 'override' ensures b::f4 is virtual.</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">virtual</span> <span class=\"kw4\">void</span> f5<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> override final <span class=\"br0\">{</span><span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span> <span class=\"co1\">// OK. d::f5 is both overriden and final.</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></code></pre>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<ul><li> <a href=\"/w/cpp/keyword/virtual\"><code>virtual</code></a>, <a href=\"/w/cpp/identifier_with_special_meaning/final\"><code>final</code></a>\n</li></ul>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Usage","id":"Usage"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"C++ identifier with special meaning: override (since C++11)","children":[{"label":"Usage"},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also"}]},"standards":[],"wordCount":108,"codeBlockCount":1}
